OL,3,GNEWSASummit held to discuss future of
OL,4,ABass Maltings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA summit has been held as part of a
OL,7,F"serious attempt" to find a use for the
OL,8,Fderelict Bass Maltings complex in
OL,9,FSleaford.
OL,11,FThe site of the Grade II*-listed
OL,12,Fbuildings was closed in 2000 and
OL,13,Fprevious attempts to regenerate it have
OL,14,Ffailed.
OL,16,FNorth Kesteven District Council (NKDC)
OL,17,Fsaid a meeting between central
OL,18,Fgovernment and local organisations took
OL,19,Fplace earlier this week to discuss the
OL,20,Fpotential for repurposing.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
