OL,3,GNEWSASummit held to discuss future of
OL,4,ABass Maltings
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Wright, the leader of the
OL,7,Fcouncil, said: "It's going to take an
OL,8,Fawful lot of money, an awful lot of
OL,9,Ftime, and some imagination on what can
OL,10,Fbe done with the building."
